title: "Shortcuts and Temporal Leakage in the Bangalore EEG Epilepsy Dataset: a Provenance Audit and Leakage-Aware Benchmark of Lightweight Seizure-Type Classifiers"
abstract: "Provenance audit and leakage-aware benchmark of seizure-type classifiers on the Bangalore EEG Epilepsy Dataset (BEED). Research work carried out as part of the 6-Month Industrial Training & Certification Program in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, jointly offered by IIT Ropar (https://www.iitrpr.ac.in/) and NIELIT Ropar (https://www.nielit.gov.in/ropar/), under MeitY, Govt. of India."
